msgid ""
"This test checks for configured Nameservers.\n"
"If you get a \"unconfirmed\" message:\n"
"- please check your DHCP, cabling and Adapter setup\n"
"- if you configured your Nameservers manually please verify your entries in "
"the \"Nameserver\" Configuration"
msgstr ""
"Ta test preverja nastavljene imenske strežnike.\n"
"Če dobiš sporočilo »nepotrjeno«:\n"
"- preveri nastavitve DHCP, kable in adapter\n"
"- če si imenske strežnike nastavil ročno, preveri vnose v nastavitvah "
"»Imenski strežnik«"

msgid ""
"This test checks whether a network cable is connected to your LAN-Adapter.\n"
"If you get a \"disconnected\" message:\n"
"- verify that a network cable is attached\n"
"- verify that the cable is not broken"
msgstr ""
"Ta test preverja, ali je omrežni kabel priključen na tvoj omrežni adapter.\n"
"Če dobiš sporočilo »brez povezave«:\n"
"- preveri, ali je omrežni kabel priključen\n"
"- preveri, ali kabel ni poškodovan"

msgid ""
"This test checks whether a valid IP Address is found for your LAN Adapter.\n"
"If you get a \"unconfirmed\" message:\n"
"- no valid IP Address was found\n"
"- please check your DHCP, cabling and adapter setup"
msgstr ""
"Ta test preverja, ali je za tvoj omrežni adapter najden veljaven naslov IP.\n"
"Če dobiš sporočilo »nepotrjeno«:\n"
"- ni bil najden veljaven naslov IP\n"
"- preveri nastavitve DHCP, kable in adapter"

msgid ""
"This test checks whether your LAN Adapter is set up for automatic IP Address "
"configuration with DHCP.\n"
"If you get a \"disabled\" message:\n"
" - then your LAN Adapter is configured for manual IP Setup\n"
"- verify thay you have entered correct IP informations in the AdapterSetup "
"dialog.\n"
"If you get an \"enabeld\" message:\n"
"-verify that you have a configured and working DHCP Server in your network."
msgstr ""
"Ta test preverja, ali je tvoj omrežni adapter nastavljen za samodejno "
"nastavitev naslova IP prek DHCP.\n"
"Če dobiš sporočilo »onemogočeno«:\n"
"- potem je tvoj omrežni adapter nastavljen za ročno nastavitev IP\n"
"- preveri, ali si v pogovornem oknu za nastavitev adapterja vnesel pravilne "
"podatke IP.\n"
"Če dobiš sporočilo »omogočeno«:\n"
"- preveri, ali imaš v omrežju delujoč in pravilno nastavljen strežnik DHCP."

msgid "This test detects your configured LAN-Adapter."
msgstr "Ta test zazna nastavljeni omrežni adapter."

